  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate sports-themed sanctuary with the cozy and stylish comforter set from Jeminise. Perfect for football fans, players, and coaches, this custom-designed bedding adds a vibrant, sporty touch to any bedroom, guestroom, or kids' room while offering a soft, lightweight layer of breathable warmth.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Features personalization support with 2 text inputs for names or numbers to create a truly unique sports-themed bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling that prevents clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for any bed, with choices including US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package comes with 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Vintage Watercolor Football Art</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
